{"id":"172b7ec1d3eb81a8","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-computable.md","title":"Computable Function","display":"df-computable — Computable Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-computable","aliases":["93-df-computable"],"display":"df-computable — Computable Function","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-computable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-computable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable — Computable Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 上定义原接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span>；这是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dfc176599ab6a95f\" href=\"?note=dfc176599ab6a95f\" title=\"93-thm-klein-completeness\">93-thm-klein-completeness</a> 实际调用的定义域。</li>\n<li>使用确定性寄存器程序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Instr}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Instr}_{93}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RUpdate}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{RUpdate}_{93}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RInit}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{RInit}_{93}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RStep}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{RStep}_{93}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RRun}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{RRun}_{93}\\)</span> 均由下列公式定义，不预设机器编号或外部可计算性谓词。</li>\n<li>更新构造的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\">\\(r\\in\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,z\\in\\omega\">\\(i,z\\in\\omega\\)</span>；初始化的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\omega\">\\(x\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是有限序列候选，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,d\">\\(c,d\\)</span> 是配置候选。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{r\\in(\\omega\\to\\omega):\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;(m\\leq i\\to r(i)=0)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{r\\in(\\omega\\to\\omega):\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;(m\\leq i\\to r(i)=0)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Instr}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle0\\rangle\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle1,i,j\\rangle:i,j\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle2,i,j,k\\rangle:i,j,k\\in\\omega\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Instr}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle0\\rangle\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle1,i,j\\rangle:i,j\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle2,i,j,k\\rangle:i,j,k\\in\\omega\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\operatorname{Instr}_{93}):{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\neq\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;[p(q)=\\langle0\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists i\\in\\omega\\;\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;(p(q)=\\langle1,i,j\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists i\\in\\omega\\;\\exists j,k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\n(p(q)=\\langle2,i,j,k\\rangle)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\operatorname{Instr}_{93}):{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\neq\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;[p(q)=\\langle0\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists i\\in\\omega\\;\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;(p(q)=\\langle1,i,j\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists i\\in\\omega\\;\\exists j,k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\n(p(q)=\\langle2,i,j,k\\rangle)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RUpdate}_{93}(r,i,z)\\coloneqq\n(r\\upharpoonright(\\omega\\setminus\\{i\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle i,z\\rangle\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RUpdate}_{93}(r,i,z)\\coloneqq\n(r\\upharpoonright(\\omega\\setminus\\{i\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle i,z\\rangle\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RInit}_{93}(x)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle0,x\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle i,0\\rangle:i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RInit}_{93}(x)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle0,x\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle i,0\\rangle:i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RStep}_{93}(p,c,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;p\\in\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\n\\land\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\\exists r\\in\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\\;[\nc=\\langle q,r\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\exists i\\in\\omega\\;\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\n[p(q)=\\langle1,i,j\\rangle\\land\nd=\\langle j,\\operatorname{RUpdate}_{93}(r,i,r(i)+1)\\rangle]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\exists i\\in\\omega\\;\\exists j,k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\n[p(q)=\\langle2,i,j,k\\rangle\\land\n((r(i)=0\\land d=\\langle j,r\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16em}\\lor(0&lt;r(i)\\land\nd=\\langle k,\\operatorname{RUpdate}_{93}(r,i,r(i)-1)\\rangle))])].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RStep}_{93}(p,c,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;p\\in\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\n\\land\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\\exists r\\in\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\\;[\nc=\\langle q,r\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\exists i\\in\\omega\\;\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\n[p(q)=\\langle1,i,j\\rangle\\land\nd=\\langle j,\\operatorname{RUpdate}_{93}(r,i,r(i)+1)\\rangle]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\exists i\\in\\omega\\;\\exists j,k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\n[p(q)=\\langle2,i,j,k\\rangle\\land\n((r(i)=0\\land d=\\langle j,r\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16em}\\lor(0&lt;r(i)\\land\nd=\\langle k,\\operatorname{RUpdate}_{93}(r,i,r(i)-1)\\rangle))])].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RRun}_{93}(p,x,y)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\np\\in\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\\land x,y\\in\\omega\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists h\\;\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\n\\exists r\\in\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\\;[\\\\\n&amp;h:(n+1)\\to\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\times\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\n\\land h(0)=\\langle0,\\operatorname{RInit}_{93}(x)\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k&lt;n\\;\\mathrm{RStep}_{93}(p,h(k),h(k+1))\\\\\n&amp;\\land h(n)=\\langle q,r\\rangle\\land p(q)=\\langle0\\rangle\\land r(0)=y].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RRun}_{93}(p,x,y)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\np\\in\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\\land x,y\\in\\omega\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists h\\;\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\n\\exists r\\in\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\\;[\\\\\n&amp;h:(n+1)\\to\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\times\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\n\\land h(0)=\\langle0,\\operatorname{RInit}_{93}(x)\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k&lt;n\\;\\mathrm{RStep}_{93}(p,h(k),h(k+1))\\\\\n&amp;\\land h(n)=\\langle q,r\\rangle\\land p(q)=\\langle0\\rangle\\land r(0)=y].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Computable}(f)\\leftrightarrow\nf:\\omega\\to\\omega\\land\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\\;\n\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{RRun}_{93}(p,x,y)\\leftrightarrow f(x)=y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Computable}(f)\\leftrightarrow\nf:\\omega\\to\\omega\\land\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\\;\n\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{RRun}_{93}(p,x,y)\\leftrightarrow f(x)=y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>程序可以不停止；Computable 只取对每个自然数输入都停止的总函数。递归可枚举性在 93-df-recursive-enumerable 中使用同一运行谓词定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-thm-klein-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"dfc176599ab6a95f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本文件在 $\\omega\\to\\omega$ 上定义原接口 $\\mathrm{Computable}$；这是 [[93-thm-klein-completeness]] 实际调用的定义域。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Instr}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RUpdate}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RInit}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RStep}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RRun}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"i,z\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"c,d","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{r\\in(\\omega\\to\\omega):\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;(m\\leq i\\to r(i)=0)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Instr}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle0\\rangle\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle1,i,j\\rangle:i,j\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle2,i,j,k\\rangle:i,j,k\\in\\omega\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\operatorname{Instr}_{93}):{}&\n\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\neq\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;[p(q)=\\langle0\\rangle\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists i\\in\\omega\\;\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;(p(q)=\\langle1,i,j\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists i\\in\\omega\\;\\exists j,k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\n(p(q)=\\langle2,i,j,k\\rangle)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RUpdate}_{93}(r,i,z)\\coloneqq\n(r\\upharpoonright(\\omega\\setminus\\{i\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle i,z\\rangle\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RInit}_{93}(x)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle0,x\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle i,0\\rangle:i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RStep}_{93}(p,c,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&p\\in\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\n\\land\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\\exists r\\in\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\\;[\nc=\\langle q,r\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land(\\exists i\\in\\omega\\;\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\n[p(q)=\\langle1,i,j\\rangle\\land\nd=\\langle j,\\operatorname{RUpdate}_{93}(r,i,r(i)+1)\\rangle]\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor\\exists i\\in\\omega\\;\\exists j,k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\n[p(q)=\\langle2,i,j,k\\rangle\\land\n((r(i)=0\\land d=\\langle j,r\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\hspace{16em}\\lor(0<r(i)\\land\nd=\\langle k,\\operatorname{RUpdate}_{93}(r,i,r(i)-1)\\rangle))])].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RRun}_{93}(p,x,y)\\leftrightarrow{}&\np\\in\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\\land x,y\\in\\omega\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists h\\;\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\n\\exists r\\in\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\\;[\\\\\n&h:(n+1)\\to\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\times\\operatorname{Reg}_{93}\n\\land h(0)=\\langle0,\\operatorname{RInit}_{93}(x)\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k<n\\;\\mathrm{RStep}_{93}(p,h(k),h(k+1))\\\\\n&\\land h(n)=\\langle q,r\\rangle\\land p(q)=\\langle0\\rangle\\land r(0)=y].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Computable}(f)\\leftrightarrow\nf:\\omega\\to\\omega\\land\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{RMProg}_{93}\\;\n\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{RRun}_{93}(p,x,y)\\leftrightarrow f(x)=y)","display":true}],"bytes":3334,"backlinks":[{"id":"5e8def090e751b3f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A$ 为集合候选；$\\mathrm{RE}_{S}$ 在此补齐，$\\mathrm{RE}_{93}$ 保留原别名接口。机器程序与运行谓词来自 [[93-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"dfc176599ab6a95f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\ell_{\\mathcal P}:\\omega\\to\\omega$ is a proposed computable last-formula map, and $\\mathrm{Computable}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-computable]]."}],"outgoing":["e30eac382dc7d1a7","dfc176599ab6a95f"]}